WEBVTT

00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:15,260
What's the negative of buying supplements through Amazon?

00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:18,580
When we do sell some of our supplements through Amazon,

00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:22,740
the problem with buying supplements through Amazon in general

00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:28,780
is that you don't know for sure if you're getting the real thing.

00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:33,900
So you don't really realize how possible it is

00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:38,300
for a Chinese company, which I say a Chinese company

00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:42,860
because 99% of the time it is a Chinese company that is doing this.

00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:48,300
Literally buy, let's say, pick a designs for health product

00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:53,060
or an ortho molecular product or a PHP product.

00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:56,260
They buy it, the bottle of it from the company,

00:00:56,260 --> 00:01:00,420
and then they literally scan and reproduce the label.

00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:06,220
And they fill capsules with literally just rice brand.

00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:08,860
And they sell it as the product.

00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:15,780
That's why most of the companies that we sell on our website,

00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:20,260
on our store do not let us sell on Amazon.

00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:24,180
They don't let us sell it on Amazon because otherwise,

00:01:24,180 --> 00:01:28,740
it's too hard to chase down all these Amazon companies.

00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:33,620
So there's so many companies that are selling bad supplements already.

00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:39,180
Legally, not just these fake companies that are selling fake designs

00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:41,340
for health products on Amazon.

00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:44,380
But there's companies that are selling,

00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:50,140
you could go to Walmart or Target and you could buy a bottle of ashwaganda,

00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:53,940
and you could bring it to your local biochemistry lab.

00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:58,060
And if you know the biochemist and you could ask him to test the,

00:01:58,060 --> 00:02:03,260
is there actually 200 milligrams of ashwaganda in each capsule?

00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:05,780
They'll find in most of the products

00:02:05,780 --> 00:02:11,020
that you can even get at GNC, Target, Walmart, whatever.

00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:14,460
They'll find that it contains less than 10%

00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:16,500
what it says on the label.

00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:20,460
So it's just, well, it's so much cheaper to buy it at Costco.

00:02:20,460 --> 00:02:22,860
Can't I just buy this product at Costco?

00:02:22,860 --> 00:02:27,140
I'm not saying that there's not maybe a good tumor product at Costco.

00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:31,180
But you're taking your chances, most of the stuff that you're getting

00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:33,340
is not good stuff.

00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:37,420
A lot of the little supplement companies and things have been bought out

00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:38,860
by the drug companies too,

00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:41,700
and they're not selling good stuff.

00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:44,100
Why? Because they can.

00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:46,220
Because they could get away with it.

00:02:46,220 --> 00:02:49,100
Because nobody's getting it tested.

00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:52,060
They're not getting independent testing done.

00:02:52,060 --> 00:02:56,260
So you have to buy reputable stuff

00:02:56,300 --> 00:03:00,700
or you're just not getting the real stuff.

00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:07,260
That's just, there's been studies I've referenced them

00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:09,740
in the past multiple times.

00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:12,220
Independent studies that have literally got it

00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:14,980
and bought products at different stores

00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:17,500
and on Amazon and test it.

00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:19,980
And they just don't, some of them had nothing in it.

00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:21,700
There was just rice bread.

